                    "fillColor": "#9ea3b0",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Inter",
                "text": "Touching the tempo figure opens the keypad over the Loop panel: a card (card fill, 1 px accent, radius 12) at top 8, right 16, bottom 8, 424 wide, with the panel behind under the scrim at 50 % and taking no touch. Left column: the TEMPO label, the entry field (JetBrains Mono 18 on the panel's base, accent edge, radius 10) with its cursor, the range under it, and Cancel at the bottom. Right: a 3\u00d74 pad of 74.7\u00d754 keys with a 4 px gap (1 to 9, the decimal point, 0, backspace), and Set across the pad's width, which names the value it will send in hundredths ('Set 92.50'). It follows the main screen's exact-tempo rules from #1653 (tempo_entry.dart): 30.00 to 300.00 BPM, at most two decimals (a third is ignored), and an empty Set or Cancel sends nothing. Laid out for the 7\u2033: the main screen's sheet stacks the pad under the field, which does not fit 375 logical high."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
